From: Tyler Smith <74526874+tylertms@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 21:54:47 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(sched): separate task-local load metadata from
 capacity

---
 kernel/sched/fork_load.c       | 104 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 kernel/sched/fork_metadata.c   |  60 -------------------
 kernel/sched/fork_sources.json |   7 ++-
 3 files changed, 110 insertions(+), 61 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 kernel/sched/fork_load.c

diff --git a/kernel/sched/fork_load.c b/kernel/sched/fork_load.c
